INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So... It is done then. I hope in peace they may finally be let free from their delusions.', 0),
(40090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is a relief to know that the delusions these once wise elders spread have been halted. I hope they will find a better place in the afterlife.', 0),
(40120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I must thank you dearly for the work you have put in. You have made it easier for us out here, but I feel you must do one more thing.', 0),
(40121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The balance of nature in the region will be restored over time. I thank you greatly, on both behalf of myself and my wife. Take this, a family heirloom. May it serve you well.', 0),
(40145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Loruk sent you. I am assuming he wishes to hear news about the Crescent Grove.', 0),
(40146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The rumors are true. There is something evil twisting the very roots of this place, and if left unchecked, could be a force unstoppable.', 0),
(40192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Faldan takes some time mulling over the items, his gaze somber and somewhat steeled>. These items surely paint a rather dark picture. If the furbolg have been relying off the land, and the land itself has become tainted, it makes sense as to what has happened.$B$BTheir creations reflect upon their mind state, and in the past, when dealing with them, I have never come across any such ornaments or carved rocks. I must prepare a letter to Darnassus, to be delivered with haste.', 0),
(40193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Faldan believes that I can assist in Ashenvale as far away as I am? The furbolg here have already begun to act in a similar manner, and there are much greater issues at stake then a tribe of savages out within the deep forests of Ashenvale.$B$BThis is not an issue that I can help with at the moment, my hands are tied, and I have more important things to deal with. When my current tasks are completed, I will begin to assist with the problems in Ashenvale.$B$BGood day.', 0),
(40197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This a tragedy, for all of Ashenvale to have such a thing happen. The forest truly has lost a bright mind this day, withered away to a foul madness that lingers in the trees.$B$BDo not feel bad, there was no averting this fate for Old Greypaw, he was a danger to both himself, and all who were near him. I pray for his spirit to transcend to Elune, and be watched for all eternity.$B$BAs much as I hate that it ended like this, I must still give you my thanks, for Greypaw was not himself, if he were around, he would have asked for such mercy to be released from his madness.', 0),
(40230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That book meant quite a lot to me, I never thought I would see it again, thank you.', 0),
(40326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is it, I didn\'t expect it would still be there. You have my thanks, with this mallet I will create a new home, and find somewhere new to settle.', 0),
(40796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Exceptional. I hope you sustained no injuries during your battles? You have aided more in one skirmish than those childish sentinels have done since they arrived.', 0),
(40797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<He peaks his ears and snatches the effigy away. He is silent for several seconds, before mewling quietly.>$B$BThis was given to me when I was a mere cub, by my parents. We bless them to protect us, always. They are deeply personal, you only ever get one in life. I sensed something I was barely able to see snatch it away as I came to Forest Song for refuge! I have no idea what they were doing to it, or why. Sometimes it is best not to ask.$B$B<Picking out the thorns, he hugs it to his chest and nods.>$B$BYou cannot know how much this means to me. I have very little, but I would have given everything away to keep this. So please, take... take.', 0),
(40798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank you kindly for your efforts, $N.$B$BDid you carry all of these in your backpack? The smell must be... Nevermind.', 0),
(40799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<She listens in quiet contemplation as you relate the masters\' advice, meditating on the words for minutes.>$B$BWait... Teloren said what??$B$B<Her face flushes with embarrassment.>', 0),
(40800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'He bowed his head? By Elune, that is amazing news! I understand. I shall spend more time with the fledglings in Sharptalon\'s presence, and with hard work and some fortune, I will make my family proud. The Moonfeathers will have yet another Hippogryph Master in their lineage!$B$BIt seems this little one doesn\'t want to leave your side. I suppose if you promise to care for and look after this child, there should be no issue in allowing it to follow you, right?$B$BThis is the least I can offer after everything you have done on my behalf. Elune smiles upon us both this day, $N.', 0),
(40801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Impressive to see one with an ounce of sensibility around here. Thank you, $N.', 0),
(40802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well done. You have already proven more useful than the sentinels, though admittedly, it is not a high bar.', 0),
(40803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I knew I could count on you, from the moment we began to talk. Truly you have earned Elune\'s favor this day, and I will make sure the word is spread of your deeds. My thanks, $N.', 0),
(40804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, the nasty business in Southern Ashenvale has come to an end, has it? Let me see what Brolthan Ironglade has achieved.', 0),
(40805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We must rest and meditate at some point, you and I. I would very much like to... what is this? A letter from The Arch Druid?', 0),
(40806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Here, take one of these as a token of our appreciation for your efforts.', 0),
(40807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Now that\'s what I like to hear! Grab your weaponry, $N.', 0),
(40808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You positively reek of blood, sweat and dirt. Have you driven them back?', 0),
(40809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<She bares her teeth and gives a wide grin.>$B$BFantastic. The sentinels shall be recalled, finally, and we shall celebrate tonight. Elun\'adore, $N!', 0),
(40810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, so our southern forests are finally free of the Horde? This is music to my ears.', 0),
(40811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A message from Tyrande directly? To me? Curious.', 0),
(40812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That is... harsh, though not unfair to the druids. I think the tension would have forced them away sooner or later anyway. And of course, feel free to choose a newly crafted weapon for your troubles.', 0),
(40842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The trees, the beasts, the wind; all of nature rejoices. In its song, it is you who are owed thanks, $N.$B$BYour bravery and tenacity in cleansing Demon Fall Canyon have bought us precious time to prepare for the final confrontation. Your actions have not gone unnoticed, and I am proud to call you a comrade in our holy war to protect these lands.', 0),
(40843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It brings great comfort to me to know that I can always rely on your dedication and courage. The satyr Varaxxius was a powerful and dangerous foe, but you have proven yourself to be an expert in combat. Your actions have saved our sacred groves from the vile ambitions of those who seek to exploit the weapon of Mannoroth for their own dark purposes.$B$BBy ending the satyr and preventing any further attempts to repair the weapon, you have struck a heavy blow to our enemies and secured a significant victory for the Kaldorei. May you ever be honored for your service to us.', 0),
(41812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Such beauty- such magnificence. I wish I could have personally laid eyes upon the ancient tree, though I thank you for the efforts you have taken to recover this. I am within your debt. Please, on behalf of us druids, take this as thanks.', 0),
(55032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It pains my soul to imagine it has come to this, it feels as if there is no light left within this once beautiful forest. I thank you for easing the troubled minds, maybe they can find clarity in the afterlife. Take this, I will need it no longer.', 0),
(70020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Loruk sent you to check on me? Is he still thinking I\'m a small calf with no horns?', 0),
(70021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank you $N, this will mend our friend.', 0),
(70022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'My horns are ready and sharpened, alas my spear was stolen by those demons, the vermin felt the blessings of the Earthmother on it!$B$BIt\'s not your fault $N, you\'ve bravely fought them and for that I am in your debt, here, have this necklace as a token of my gratitude.', 0),
(70023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I was expecting someone else to give me this report, $R, what happened to Norvok?', 0),
(70024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Already done?', 0),
(70025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'With the interference of the elves gone we can resume our duty in peace. Thank you $N, you are more capable than I thought.', 0),
(70026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have my thanks $N, your work helped me and my men more than you\'d imagine, as a sign of gratitude the leatherworker made this for you.', 0),
(70027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Now, what do I do with you?', 0),
(70028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good. While their numbers are Legions and our arms never rest, we will prevail thanks to the sheer desire to survive overcoming their plans to conquer.$B$BCome, I have few items saved as payment. Choose whichever fits you best.', 0),
(70029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A Dreadlord of all things? This won\'t be easy, at your current state you\'re nothing more than a twig in a cyclone, but there are other ways.', 0),
(70030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, hello mon, I didn\'t notice you, what do you want?', 0),
(70031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'My stew is almost done, let\'s have a taste.$B$BTerrible!$B$BI mean, it tastes better than my wife\'s cooking.', 0),
(70032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That daft fool just won\'t let go of it! I told him we were not playing on coin, gah.$B$B<Grimeye clears his throat.>$B$BIn any case $N, well done. Now let\'s go kill us a dreadlord.', 0),
(70033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done something not many can do, $C, walk with pride from this day onward.$B$BThis old orc is reminded of the past but from now on he will dream of the future.$B$BI will set fire to the head and mention you the slayer to our clan, but the ancestors tell me your path only begins my dear friend.$B$BI truly hope you will one day find what you seek.', 0),
(70034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This spear served my family for many generations.$B$BI am saddened that I was the one to bring it to its end, and brought shame upon my tribe.$B$B<Norvok takes a deep breath through his huge nostrils and lets the air out with a smile.>$B$BDon\'t look sad my newest friend, you helped me more than you know, this is not the end but merely the beginning.$B$BI will reforge the blade and make it more sturdy, after all even when you cut a hawk\'s wings his beak is as dangerous as ever.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40089, 0, 0, 'It pains me to ask, but have you gotten the badges?', 0),
(40090, 0, 0, 'Have they been silenced? Have the whisperings of the elders ceased?', 0),
(40120, 0, 0, 'Have you made the forests a safer place, friend?', 0),
(40121, 0, 0, 'The beast, Ghoststalker, have you dispatched him?', 0),
(40145, 0, 0, 'Yes? Is there anything you need from me?', 0),
(40146, 0, 0, 'So, were my suspicions correct?', 0),
(40192, 0, 0, 'Remember to be careful, there may still be some lurking about, or even other potential dangers.', 0),
(40193, 0, 0, 'Yes, what is it?$B$BI am busy, you must have something for me.', 0),
(40197, 0, 0, 'He may act hostile, but I assure you, it is not within his nature, and deep down, he truly is a kind soul.', 0),
(40230, 0, 0, 'That place is crawling with murloc, I would advise you steel yourself for what must be done.', 0),
(40326, 0, 0, 'Crescent Grove is a dangerous place, I would advise that you bring help if you are to go there.', 0),
(40796, 0, 0, 'Blights on the land can be hidden with ease, but healed with difficulty. Remember this.', 0),
(40797, 0, 0, '<The Furbolg watches you curiously as you approach.>', 0),
(40798, 0, 0, 'Welcome back. Have you brought the hippogryph food?', 0),
(40799, 0, 0, 'I hope you come bearing word from the masters, $N.', 0),
(40800, 0, 0, 'Hello, $N. Did you find Sharptalon?', 0),
(40801, 0, 0, 'I suppose you are going to be as unhelpful as the sentinels then?', 0),
(40802, 0, 0, 'How has the hunt been so far? Anything to report?', 0),
(40803, 0, 0, 'I pray you return with good news, $N?', 0),
(40804, 0, 0, 'Speak swiftly, I have numerous other burdens upon my shoulders, if you are going to add to them, I demand you at least do so and leave quickly.', 0),
(40805, 0, 0, 'Ah, $N! I hear we have you to thank for bringing this conflict to an end!', 0),
(40806, 0, 0, 'You returned for your reward, I take it? Yes, I thought as much.', 0),
(40807, 0, 0, 'So? Interested in turning the tide?', 0),
(40808, 0, 0, 'You return already?', 0),
(40809, 0, 0, 'Is it done? Are the southern forests free of the Horde, at last?', 0),
(40810, 0, 0, 'Greetings, $C. What brings you to our Temple?', 0),
(40811, 0, 0, 'Ah, the hero of the hour. Speak quickly, $N, I rather wish to be left alone currently. The drunken singing of the sentinels is making it rather hard to meditate.', 0),
(40812, 0, 0, '$N! Drink?', 0),
(40842, 0, 0, 'Our war with the Legion has been waged across many millennia, through countless battlefields.$B$BWe are the guardians of this world and we will not suffer them to taint it.', 0),
(40843, 0, 0, 'They say the orcs have left a monument to Grommash in the canyon.$B$BI hope you have spat on it.', 0),
(41812, 0, 0, 'Travel carefully, the depths of Blackfathom are crawling with evil.', 0),
(55032, 0, 0, 'If nothing is done, my friends and kin will slay the innocent senselessly. It must be done...', 0),
(70020, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(70021, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(70022, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(70023, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(70024, 0, 0, 'Clean the camp of the wildthorn menace and I will see you rewarded.', 0),
(70025, 0, 0, 'Go get your hands dirty, leave none alive, and if anything make sure more of the peons don\'t die.', 0),
(70026, 0, 0, 'Remember, only hunt the eldest of the bears.', 0),
(70027, 0, 0, 'So, Grushak finally reporting on his peons doing their job for once?', 0),
(70028, 0, 0, 'I take it you\'re not a coward, so why are you still here?', 0),
(70029, 0, 0, 'Hopefully you will survive to tell the story, $C.', 0),
(70030, 0, 0, 'Three little elves hugging the trees, ol\' Jin\'Zil will be cooking soon!', 0),
(70031, 0, 0, 'Hey, $N, I wonder what $R tastes like.$B$BBut don\'t worry I won\'t be eating you! Maybe.', 0),
(70032, 0, 0, 'What took you this long?', 0),
(70033, 0, 0, 'Bring me his severed head and I will set it on fire!', 0),
(70034, 0, 0, 'Y-yes?', 0);
